/Title (Sabrina Mayfeather An independent tutor with Polish-American roots. She studied social anthropology at the University of St Andrews in Scotland and performance art at Drama Centre London \(University of the Arts London\). She brings to this guide the perspective of someone working where education, culture, expression, and presence meet. In her voice, certain themes keep returning: attention to your own state, healthy boundaries, curiosity, and creating a space where a young person can gradually find their own confidence.)
